,"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cajun/Creole, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"htDRn1cXDyimxz6BJWB3LQ","review_id":"zlGXvhVZ7NlKDK7EZsiLKQ","date":"2021-09-02T05:17:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9435023069381714,"text_excerpt":"This place has a very cool modern feel to it and great pasta! I came for dinner during Restaurant Week with a couple friends from work and had a great time. I loved the aesthetic of the restaurant, and the service was also welcoming and attentive. For drinks, we ordered the On the Beach and Louisiana Harvest. Both were delicious and not too expensive. I ordered the Insalata Tricolore, while both my friends had the Fried Brussels Sprouts Salad. I definitely wished I ordered the brussels sprouts because they were perfectly fried and flavorful, although mine was also very tasty. For the second course, we each ordered the JE Fried Chicken, JE Meatballs, and Grilled Peaches & Burrata. The flav..."},{"business_id":"htDRn1cXDyimxz6BJWB3LQ","review_id":"HPco0uYJKmj_w5EIPW6Ycg","date":"2019-01-04T21:21:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9405511617660522,"text_excerpt":"This is a beautiful restaurant. They have a great happy hour, with 3 pastas, the burger and 2 salads for good prices. My husband and I had heard so much about the house made pastas, and are so glad we tried them! We shared the Mafalde and the Cacio e Pepe. The Mafalde was a thick, rich meat sauce and was delicious, other than being a bit too salty. The Casio e pepe sauce was creamy and peppery, very good. Both pastas were excellent- hearty and cooked to a perfect al dente. We are excited to come back and try more delicious dishes :) The service was very friendly as well."},{"business_id":"htDRn1cXDyimxz6BJWB3LQ","review_id":"kzxWaAbhaa6Zj3w6-yds-Q","date":"2016-11-22T03:33:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9393868446350098,"text_excerpt":"I came here tonight with some friends. This was my third time here and I think the best experience I have had here thus far. We ordered the fusilli, the bucatini, the fall pasta (wasn't called that on the menu but it was mini raviolis with nuts, pumpkin, and brown butter sauce), and another pasta dish with mushrooms and truffle oil. For apps we did the beets and the meat and cheese plate. The apps were great. I also really enjoyed the pasta dishes, all were tasty but we thought the pasta could have been cooked a bit more, more \"al dente\" style. My friend really enjoyed his cocktails. We also got the peanut butter dessert. It was just ok. I love the decor of this place and the service was ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id